# Open the Armory: "Search your library for an Aura or Equipment card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle."
# Bot1's library holds an Aura (Animate Dead), an Equipment (Colossus Hammer) and a Mox Ruby, which is neither. Bot1
# refuses the Mox Ruby as a find, and takes the Aura.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Open the Armory
Island x4
Mox Ruby
Animate Dead
Colossus Hammer
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
